<title>USA: CBOT/CME closing trends - July 7.</title>
<headline>CBOT/CME closing trends - July 7.</headline>
<text>
<p>Wheat    dn  6 3/4 cts/bu    Live Cattle  dn 0.400 cts/lb</p>
